; With no periodic transactions, --forecast-while has nothing to bound.
; A balance report then never evaluates its predicate: accounts reports
; install no forecast-while filter_posts, and forecast_posts evaluates the
; predicate only on generated forecast groups.  An invalid predicate (the
; bare word Food) therefore goes unreported in bal, and the report prints
; the plain balance.  reg still evaluates the predicate on every posting
; and reports the error.  (bal --budget is a separate case, pinned by
; forecast-while-balance-budget.test.)

2030/03/01 Grocer
    Expenses:Food    $10.00
    Assets:Cash

test bal --forecast-while Food --now 2030/06/15
             $-10.00  Assets:Cash
              $10.00  Expenses:Food
--------------------
                   0
end test
